      <h1 class="Title"><a name="SR"></a>STATUTORY REFERENCES FOR ARIZONA CITIES AND TOWNS</h1>
            <p class="P1">The statutory references listed below refer the code user to state statutes applicable to Arizona cities and towns. They are up to date through legislation adopted by the 55th Legislature, Second Regular Session (2022).</p>

      <h3 class="Cite" id="General Provisions"><a name="General Provisions">General Provisions</a></h3>
            <p class="P0">Adoption of city charter. </p>

            <p class="P2">A.R.S. &sect; <a href="//www.codepublishing.com/cgi-bin/ars.pl?cite=9-281" target="_parent">9-281</a> et seq.</p>

            <p class="P0">Adoption of codes. </p>

            <p class="P2">A.R.S. &sect; <a href="//www.codepublishing.com/cgi-bin/ars.pl?cite=9-801" target="_parent">9-801</a> et seq.</p>

            <p class="P0">Civil enforcement of ordinances. </p>

            <p class="P2">A.R.S. &sect; <a href="//www.codepublishing.com/cgi-bin/ars.pl?cite=9-500.21" target="_parent">9-500.21</a></p>

            <p class="P0">Elections.</p>

            <p class="P2">A.R.S. &sect; <a href="//www.codepublishing.com/cgi-bin/ars.pl?cite=9-821" target="_parent">9-821</a> et seq.</p>

            <p class="P0">General powers.</p>

            <p class="P2">A.R.S. &sect;&sect; <a href="//www.codepublishing.com/cgi-bin/ars.pl?cite=9-240" target="_parent">9-240</a>, <a href="//www.codepublishing.com/cgi-bin/ars.pl?cite=9-276" target="_parent">9-276</a>, <a href="//www.codepublishing.com/cgi-bin/ars.pl?cite=9-499.01" target="_parent">9-499.01</a></p>

            <p class="P0">Penalties.</p>

            <p class="P2">A.R.S. &sect; <a href="//www.codepublishing.com/cgi-bin/ars.pl?cite=9-240" target="_parent">9-240</a>(B)(28)</p>

            <p class="P0">Prisoners.</p>

            <p class="P2">A.R.S. &sect; <a href="//www.codepublishing.com/cgi-bin/ars.pl?cite=9-499.07" target="_parent">9-499.07</a></p>

